────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
关于素材（重要）

上面这份 MIT 许可覆盖的是**本项目的代码**。

仓库里随附的角色素材各自归属其原作者，并各自适用自己的许可 —— 它们同样是
MIT 或等价的宽松许可，与上面的条款兼容。逐个来源、作者与许可见
`assets/ATTRIBUTION.md`。

仓库**不包含**任何授权不明确或不兼容的素材。clawd-on-desk 的主题素材
（calico / cloudling / whale-chan）已被 `.gitignore` 排除，原因见该文件的注释
与 `assets/ATTRIBUTION.md`。加载器本身是代码，在 MIT 覆盖范围内。

────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
About the assets

The MIT grant above covers **this project's code**.

The bundled character assets belong to their respective authors and carry their
own licenses. All of them are MIT or equivalently permissive, and therefore
compatible with the terms above. Per-asset source, author and license are listed
in `assets/ATTRIBUTION.md`.

This repository deliberately **ships no asset whose licensing is unclear or
incompatible**. The clawd-on-desk theme assets (calico / cloudling /
whale-chan) are excluded via `.gitignore` — see that file's comments and
`assets/ATTRIBUTION.md` for the reasoning. The theme *loader* is code and is
covered by the MIT grant.
